  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special Measure 2024: EU4People of Belarus: Strengthen Civic Forces, Human Rights and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Special Measure 2024 &#xBF;Strengthen civic forces, human rights and education&#xBF; is to preserve an independent civic space, enabling a diversity of views, as well as to support unbiased quality education to Belarusians in a repressive environment.Specific objectives:1)Specific Objective 1 (Outcome 1): Increased capacities and effectiveness of Belarusian civil society, pro-democracy actors, human rights defenders as well as independent media to reach out to beneficiaries and relevant audiences.2)  Specific Objective 2 (Outcome 2):&amp;nbsp;Belarusians have access to unbiased quality education based on best practices in terms of design and learning content.</narrative>
  </description>
